# Mobile: About Scroll Reveals + Menu Restructure

Two mobile-only (`max-width: 768px`) changes are scoped so desktop is not affected.

---

## Proposed Changes

### 1. About Section — Snap-scroll Group Reveals

The 5 bento items will be split into **3 reveal groups** that animate in sequence as the user scrolls through the about section. To make it feel like snap-scroll (lively, section-by-section), the section will remain `100vh` on mobile but scroll internally, with each group pinned to the center as it fades/slides in.

**Groups:**
| Group | Elements | Animation |
|-------|----------|-----------|
| 1 | Title + "Our Story" label | Slide up from bottom |
| 2 | First video + Heritage info box | Slide in from left |
| 3 | Description text + Second video | Slide up from bottom |

**Implementation:** Use `ScrollTrigger` with `pin: true` inside the about section on mobile. Each group will use `toggleActions: "play none none reverse"` for bi-directional feel. The about section height will be extended to `~250vh` on mobile to give scroll room, with the inner content appearing pinned at the center.

---

#### [MODIFY] [index.html](file:///c:\Users\Administrator\Desktop\pizza\index.html)
- Wrap each bento group in a `<div class="about-reveal-group">` wrapper with data-group index
- No structural change to desktop layout

#### [MODIFY] [style.css](file:///c:\Users\Administrator\Desktop\pizza\style.css)
- Under `@media (max-width: 768px)`: hide all groups by default (`opacity: 0, transform: translateY(60px)`), let GSAP drive visibility
- About section becomes a tall scroll track (`height: 250vh`) with pinned inner content container

#### [MODIFY] [script.js](file:///c:\Users\Administrator\Desktop\pizza\script.js)
- Add `isMobile()` helper (`window.innerWidth <= 768`)
- In [initScrollAnimations()](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Desktop/pizza/script.js#48-114), if mobile: loop over `.about-reveal-group` elements and create staggered `ScrollTrigger` per group using `scrub` + `pin`

---

### 2. Flavor Sections — Mobile Layout Restructure

**New layout (top → bottom):**
```
[ Category text — left side, vertical ]
[ Product Name — top center ]
[ Price — large stroke text, layered above image ]
[ Product Image — center, slides in from right ]
[ Ingredients — bottom ]
```

**Key points:**
- Category label moves from the fixed center indicator to inline inside the section on mobile
- Price is a `data-price` attribute on the section (needs to be added to HTML), rendered as large outlined/stroked text behind-but-over the image using `z-index`
- Image slides in from the right instead of from below
- All changes scoped to mobile only via `@media (max-width: 768px)`

#### [MODIFY] [index.html](file:///c:\Users\Administrator\Desktop\pizza\index.html)
- Add `data-price="1200 DZD"` to each `flavor-section`
- Inside `.flavor-layout` add:
  - `.mobile-product-name` (hidden on desktop)
  - `.mobile-price` (hidden on desktop)
  - `.mobile-category` (hidden on desktop)
  - These are populated by JS on load for mobile

#### [MODIFY] [style.css](file:///c:\Users\Administrator\Desktop\pizza\style.css)
- Under `@media (max-width: 768px)`:
  - `.flavor-layout`: `flex-direction: column`, centered, full height
  - `.mobile-product-name`: top, large font
  - `.mobile-price`: absolute center of image container, very large stroked font (`-webkit-text-stroke`), `z-index: 5`
  - `.floating-img`: `z-index: 3` (behind price stroke)
  - `.mobile-category`: rotated 90deg on the left side

#### [MODIFY] [script.js](file:///c:\Users\Administrator\Desktop\pizza\script.js)
- On mobile, inject `.mobile-product-name`, `.mobile-price`, `.mobile-category` elements into each `.flavor-section` from `data-*` attributes
- Change [initFlavorAnimations()](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Desktop/pizza/script.js#323-351) to slide image from `x: 120%` (right) instead of `y: 50` on mobile

