## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1. Open [index.html](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Desktop/pizza/index.html) in a browser (can use Live Server or just open the file)
2. Open DevTools → toggle device toolbar → set to iPhone 14 (390×844) or similar
3. **About section**: Scroll past the hero — verify each group of elements reveals one at a time with a lively animation feel
4. **Flavor section**: Scroll to menu — verify:
   - Product name is at the top
   - Category label is on the left side (rotated)
   - Image enters from the right
   - Price text is visible over/on top of image with stroke style
   - Ingredients are at the bottom
5. Switch back to desktop width (1440px) — verify **nothing changed** on desktop
